ouse brain, and at recent growth rates, they could reach the range of a human brain within five to 10 years.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/19/could-ai-be-conscious">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;G0Iz0HUpAwJLqF42mPHbeWW7QkN1F9G483Ug95KXV0Iƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkvCould AI be conscious?ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xKFOnbWwm4c2x4EfFzwgtIx0VDQhUp3B1_RC9Bwe-cwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;9o0NMnpPdr8smv7WhWwEu-h-MeM1_SSBK3uYncG3lPcƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxHhttps://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/19/could-ai-be-consciousƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;8u-gtDfww1oKhBXYekBtQQNMQMKVbKC7Ls7ad_O3za0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkucould-ai-be-consciousƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;xkQq73LXWGbTzLbYFhddoc_hsfVMWUxZfWs3QchrRrYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkwSyndicationSourceBundleƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;3--acaXA6Vro4E7iQ7RREhGTNbVfrtJjzOQYHQAGL9Eƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkjtechnologyƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;O6TYKHipasMyHhBr2Wp37qpYZQ6Q2yTSVUHCkiE0nbwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;Z3d4WTlW1bie3nSXNf_BIhlAtZ5Vugkm7ShymF5sPboƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;U1eWiiNsAd1uDEowfVKcmKwhULq2DhES4BH7IhSabU0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftd